{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sNbj0VSa4Z1793097332.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港樹仁大學歷史博物館開幕，展出兩名創辦人胡鴻烈及鍾期榮創立本港首間私立大學的過程。</p><p></p><p>博物館位於教學大樓地下，佔地約3,000平方呎。講述上世紀本港大學學位不足，中文教育在殖民地時代被邊緣化。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHUEYAN-1530.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266KvGIdiyvm1793097409.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHUEYAN-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bB7D4tsMys1793097487.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>兩名創辦人，中國首位女法官鍾期榮，及曾任外交官的胡鴻烈以個人積蓄創辦樹仁書院。並堅持大學四年制，經多年評審與政府制度改革，終在2006年成為本港首間私立大學。</p><p></p><p>博物館亦展出兩名創辦人生前的物品，包括大律師袍、假髮及金紫荊星章等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:53.814681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:12.583161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:34.532786+00:00","content_hash":"972013ab88c5cab1c44c86dd55da41c07de870385085a2d2679d584e7f718f16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:53.814681+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}